item.description:
Inside: Risers and fallers after a Sunday of upsets, injuries and game-winning kicks. Plus the penalty that left Sean McVay justifiably irate and a note from Michael Silver&#8217;s Wake-up Call. Let&#8217;s go.

This article is from The Athletic&#8217;s NFL newsletter. Sign up here to receive it directly in your inbox. It&#8217;s free to subscribe. 


I took the plunge yesterday into various online forums filled with 3-0 Raiders fans. I consistently found three themes:

&#8220;We will never lose again.&#8221;
&#8220;I am about to be so insufferable.&#8221;
&#8220;If we ever win a Super Bowl...
